msgid "Co-Work"
msgstr "Co-Work"

#: crates/ui-egui/src/lib.rs:4660
msgid "Co-Work (CW): host this project for others on BIMCraft, or join someone's session, and see each other's edits live"
msgstr ""

#: crates/ui-egui/src/cowork.rs:735
msgid "Co-Work lets others on BIMCraft work on this project with you, live (Collaborate > Co-Work, CW)."
msgstr "O Co-Work permite que outras pessoas trabalhem com você neste projeto no BIMCraft, ao vivo (Colaborar > Co-Work, CW)."

